BOSS Sargoth Reset
    Events
        Time - Every 5.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        ((Units in SargothLair <gen> owned by Player 1 (Red)) is empty) Equal to True
    Actions
        Set VariableSet BossSargothReset = True
        -------- =================== --------
        -------- Issue spawned spiders to move back into the forest --------
        Set VariableSet SargothSpiderAttackPoint = (Random point in SargothSpiders2 <gen>)
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in SargothSpiderGroup and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        ((Picked unit) is alive) Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        Unit - Set (Picked unit) movement speed to 350.00
                        Unit - Add a 8.00 second Generic expiration timer to (Picked unit)
                        Unit - Order (Picked unit) to Move To SargothSpiderAttackPoint
                    Else - Actions
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_SargothSpiderAttackPoint)
        -------- Destroy attacking spiders group --------
        Custom script:   call DestroyGroup(udg_SargothSpiderGroup)
        -------- =================== --------
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Sargoth Movement <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Sargoth SpiderGroup <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Sargoth Burrow 25 <gen>
        Trigger - Turn off BOSS Sargoth Burrow 50 <gen>
        Trigger - Remove BOSS Sargoth Burrow 25 Q <gen> from the trigger queue
        Trigger - Remove BOSS Sargoth Burrow 50 Q <gen> from the trigger queue
        -------- =================== --------
        -------- Reset Boss + other starting initials --------
        Unit - Set life of BossSargoth to 100.00%
        -------- Allow boss start --------
        Trigger - Turn on BOSS Sargoth Start <gen>
        -------- turn off this trigger --------
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
